window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Yuletide, the Court of Fools, and unpredictable magic!</b></p> <p>Stan, the town’s pseudo-druid, has decided the Christmas festivities will be different this year. He announces he is the Lord of Misrule and appoints his Court of Fools.</p> <p><i>Very quickly odd things start to happen.</i></p> <p>Magic and paranormal characteristics are unveiled, throwing everything into disarray, and making life very difficult for the witches and their friends.</p> <p><i>And unfortunately, darker events occur, too.</i></p> <p>Unless Avery, Alex, and the other witches can find a solution, Yuletide may not be as joyous as they hoped.</p> <p><b>Join the White Haven witches for winter solstice magic and mayhem in this seasonal novella.</b></p>"; 
